# Google Cloud Console → enable "Places API" (or "Places API (New)") → create an API key.
# Billing must be enabled on the project even though personal usage stays within the free tier.
# Restrict the key to the Places API only — no HTTP referrer restriction needed, since it's
# only ever called from the server (client never sees this key).
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_key_here
